Carry users' customisations of the legacy mention push rules `.m.rule.contains_user_name` and `.m.rule.roomnotif`, which [Matrix v1.17](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.19/client-server-api/#predefined-rules) removed from the base push rule set, over to the intentional mention rules `.m.rule.is_user_mention` and `.m.rule.is_room_mention` on a best-effort basis.
